{
  "file_name": "f005.bf",
  "original_path": "fld/f/f005/f005.bf",
  "total_messages": 128,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "offset": "YES_NO",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Yes.\nNo.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "offset": "hungry",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> Serph and the party feel hungry...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "offset": "hungry02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> They grew weak from hunger.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "offset": "heat_001_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "We're too close to the Brutes...\nWe can't hide Sera here.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "offset": "heat_001_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What kinda place is paradise?\nI know Sera will be there...\nI imagine a crystal blue sea...\na clear, sunny sky... with you,\nArgilla, and Cielo...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "offset": "heat_001_02b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I wish I knew... what the hell\nthat meant.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "offset": "heat_001_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "If Sera's not in Nirvana, then\nI won't be either.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "offset": "heat_SISEI_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Damn these bastards!\nMakin' us waste our time...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "offset": "heat_SISEI_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It's not like we can help people\nwho have already been devoured.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "offset": "heat_SISEI_02b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Hurry up! We need to find Sera!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "offset": "heat_SISEI_03a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "You care too much about others,\ny'know that?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "offset": "heat_SISEI_03b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "If we're gonna do this,\nthen hurry the hell up, already!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "offset": "heat_SISEI_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sera... don't do anything stupid.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "offset": "heat_SISEI_05a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What a waste of time.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "offset": "heat_SISEI_05b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Okay, everyone's happy.\nLet's get going!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "offset": "aljira_001_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I wonder if Jinana has already\nrisen to the clouds...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "offset": "aljira_001_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Things will be different in\nNirvana.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "offset": "aljira_001_02b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Jinana...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "offset": "aljira_001_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I thought things were different\nin Nirvana, but now...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "offset": "aljira_SISEI_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Nobody's here... Don't tell me\nthey've all been...!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "offset": "aljira_SISEI_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "This couldn't have happened at\na worse time!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "offset": "aljira_SISEI_03a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "This Atma crap only accomplishes\none thing.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "offset": "aljira_SISEI_03b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What good is a world where one\nperson stands alone on the bodies\nof his slain enemies?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "offset": "aljira_SISEI_04a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "We've killed three of them,\nso that means their boss must\nbe in the final area.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "offset": "aljira_SISEI_04b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "...But, something doesn't seem\nright, don't you think?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "offset": "aljira_SISEI_05a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Let's get back to the tower,\nSerph.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "offset": "aljira_SISEI_05b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It's time to face our destiny, and\nlearn the truth about our lives.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "offset": "gale_001_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "The same thing is happening here.\nI had intended to make use of\nthe Solids' manpower.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "offset": "gale_001_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "The law states we must reach\nNirvana. No additional reason\nshould be necessary.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "offset": "gale_001_03a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "The law dictates that we strive\nto reach Nirvana simply because\nwe're told to do so.\nBut, I have my own reasons now.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "offset": "gale_001_03b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "In Nirvana, I will find out who\nI really am... and who that woman is.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "offset": "gale_001_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "The end may in fact be a new\nbeginning.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "offset": "gale_SISEI_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "They either fled, or were\ndevoured.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "offset": "gale_SISEI_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Whichever case, the report seems\nto be true.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "offset": "gale_SISEI_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Dealing with them will not change\nour situation.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "offset": "gale_SISEI_02b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "However, they did kill some\nof our comrades.\nThis could be considered revenge\nfor such needless killing.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "offset": "gale_SISEI_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "If we are victorious, then all\nwars will end.\nI truly hope that this comes\nto pass.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "offset": "gale_SISEI_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "There isn't time to lose.\nIf we're going to eliminate them,\nlet's do it quickly.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "offset": "gale_SISEI_05a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sera knows all about this world,\nand everything about us.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "offset": "gale_SISEI_05b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Let's head for the Temple, Serph.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "offset": "ciero_001_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I think I'd get along wit' dem, ja?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "offset": "ciero_001_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "You get t'Nirvana by killin'\nde most people, ja?\nDen, how can ya really call dat\nparadise?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "offset": "ciero_001_03a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Nirvana...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "offset": "ciero_001_03b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It must be one nice place, brudda.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "offset": "ciero_SISEI_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What de hell dey want now?\nWe already won, ja?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "offset": "ciero_SISEI_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What should we do, bro?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "offset": "ciero_SISEI_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It sucks dat we gotta deal wit\ndis instead of just going to\nde Temple.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "offset": "ciero_SISEI_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Three places down, ja?\nLet's look for deir boss, then!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "offset": "ciero_SISEI_05",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "All our comrades were s'posed ta\ngo to Nirvana wit' us...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "offset": "sera_001_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "In this world, those who die rise\nto the clouds and become rain.\nThat's--\nOh... My head hurts...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "offset": "sera_001_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "My Nirvana is being here, with all\nof you. This is where I belong.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "offset": "npc01_001_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Dose of us who won't give up\nare still hangin' in da Citadel.\nBe careful there, bro.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "offset": "npc02_001_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I'd prefer a Tribe who can really\nget my groove thing shakin'.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "offset": "npc02_001_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sign me up, boss.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "offset": "npc02_001_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "What do you think paradise is\nreally like?\nI don't think things will be\ndifferent there unless we become\ndifferent, ourselves.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "offset": "npc02_001_03a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "So it's Nirvana time, huh?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "offset": "npc02_001_03b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Nah, count me out.\nI have a feeling I'm better off\ndown here.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "offset": "npc03_001_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "OK, yo, let's hear it.\nEmbryon's in the Junkyizzle,\nkinna get a hell YEAH!?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "offset": "npc03_001_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Embryon, tell me mon, is the Nirvana\nwhere y'wanna bounce to the yo\nand jiggity go?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "offset": "heat_01a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I don't like this at all...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "offset": "heat_01b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Reason?\nHow the hell should I know?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "offset": "heat_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I told you we shoulda devoured\nher. What a freaking waste...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "offset": "heat_03a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "No use crying over the past.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "offset": "heat_03b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Go tell her that.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "offset": "heat_05a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "That Citadel will be ours pretty\nsoon...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "offset": "heat_05b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "So you just worry about getting\nSera back.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "offset": "aljira_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I guess we'll need to do this\nJinana's way.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "offset": "aljira_02a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Jinana...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "offset": "aljira_02b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Sorry...\nI shouldn't be thinking like this.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "offset": "aljira_03a",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "When Jinana died, we became her\ncomrades.\nBut, if we had killed Bat,\nJinana would still be alive.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "offset": "aljira_03b",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Which one would be the best\nresult?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "offset": "aljira_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Enough, already!\nWe don't have time for lectures!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "offset": "aljira_05",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "You like this place that much?\nWhy? Nothing here is worthwhile.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "offset": "gale_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Mick is invading Manipura.\nThere is no reason to be here.\nI do not comprehend.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "offset": "gale_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Strategically, there is no reason\nto be here.\nBat's diversion was intended to\ndistract us in order for the main\nforces to capture Sera.\nThus, wasting time here plays into\nthe enemy's hands, and puts us\nat a disadvantage.\nWe must move quickly if we are to\nensure Sera's safety and stymie\nMick's plans.\nWhat I mean to say, is that we\nneed to return to headquarters\nimmediately.\nDo you understand, Serph?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "offset": "gale_02_SEL",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I understand.\nI do not understand.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "offset": "gale_02_ans0",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Then, let us be on our way.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "offset": "gale_02_ans1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I shall repeat it, then:\nStrategically, there is no reason\nto be here.\nBat's diversion was intended to\ndistract us in order for the main\nforces to capture Sera.\nThus, wasting time here plays into\nthe enemy's hands, and puts us\nat a disadvantage.\nWe must move quickly if we are to\nensure Sera's safety and stymie\nMick's plans.\nWhat I mean to say, is that we\nneed to return to headquarters\nimmediately.\nDo you understand, Serph?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 78,
      "offset": "gale_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "We need to return to headquarters\nimmediately.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "offset": "gale_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "A second repetition seems\nsuperfluous, but so be it:\nWhen circumstances change, so do\nintended destinations. There is\nno reason to remain here.\nThe Solids are fortified at the\nCitadel and coordinate 136.\nThe Citadel is already clear.\nThusly, coordinate 136 remains.\nWe must go now to coordinate 136.\nIt is quite simple, really.\nDo you comprehend?",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 80,
      "offset": "gale_03_SEL",
      "block_type": "sel",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I comprehend.\nI do not comprehend.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 81,
      "offset": "gale_03_ans0",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Then coordinate 136 is our new\ndestination. Let us proceed.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "offset": "gale_03_ans1",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I shall repeat it, then.\nA second repetition seems\nsuperfluous, but so be it:\nWhen circumstances change, so do\nintended destinations. There is\nno reason to remain here.\nThe Solids are fortified at the\nCitadel and coordinate 136.\nThe Citadel is already clear.\nThusly, coordinate 136 remains.\nWe must go now to coordinate 136.\nIt is quite simple, really.\nDo you comprehend?",
